# FUNERAL MARCH - Chopin, Piano Sonata No. 2 in B flat minor, Op. 35, third movement (1839).
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files". Instruments are tables with
# one entry per frame; each channel holds named tracks; the lines at the end are the
# order list. In a track '.' holds and '-' releases. '#' starts a comment.
#
# Public domain: Chopin died in 1849. Its first phrase - B flat, B flat B flat, B flat, and
# the fall D flat C C B flat B flat A B flat - over the left hand's tolling B flat minor and
# G flat chords, written from the melody everyone knows. Two bars and a last chord, played
# once: a game-over jingle of about eleven seconds.
#
# A row is a sixteenth, a line a bar of 4/4, at 64 quarter notes a minute - a slow march.
#
# What four channels keep. Channel 1 is the tolling chords, one a beat; channel 2 the tune,
# whose instrument swells from soft so each repeated B flat is heard; channels 3 and 4 a
# 16-bit bass under the chords. The last line holds B flat minor and 'end' lets it fade.

song   FUNERAL MARCH
key    B FLAT MINOR

instrument TOLL
  table      tone
  volume     8 7 7 6 6 5 5 4 4 3 3 2
  distortion tone
  release    1

# In from soft, so a note that follows itself is heard as a new one.
instrument DIRGE
  table      tone
  volume     6 10 11 11 10 10 10 9 9 9 8 8 8 8 7 7 7 7 7 6
  distortion tone
  release    1

instrument LOW
  table      wide
  volume     11 11 10 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5
  distortion tone
  release    1

channel 1 notes CHORDS
  note  B flat minor and G flat, a chord a beat, as the left hand tolls them.
  voice TOLL
  track TOLL Bbm . . .  Gb . . .  Bbm . . .  Gb . . .
  track LAST Bbm . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 2 notes TUNE
  note  B flat, B flat B flat, B flat - D flat C, C B flat, B flat A, B flat.
  voice DIRGE
  track F1 Bb4 . . .  Bb4 . . Bb4  Bb4 . . .  Bb4 . . Db5
  track F2 C5 . . Bb4  Bb4 . . A4  Bb4 . . .  . . . .

channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of the bass. AUDCTL 28 joins channels 3 and 4 on the 1.79 MHz clock.

channel 4 notes BASS
  note  B flat and G flat under the chords.
  voice LOW
  track BL Bb1 . . .  Gb1 . . .  Bb1 . . .  Gb1 . . .
  track BF Bb1 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

# The order list: a line is a bar. Chords, tune, low byte, bass.
speed  14
audctl $28
section MARCH
line   TOLL    F1      .       BL
line   TOLL    F2      .       BL
line   LAST    .       .       BF
end
